---
import SectionHeader from "./SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section id="typography">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeader num="04" title="Typography" sub="Sans leads UI. Serif for editorial and CJK text. Mono for code." />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="p-7 rounded-xl border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <div class="mb-4 font-sans">
          <div class="text-[56px] font-bold leading-none text-brand-primary">Aa</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-foreground-tertiary">Sans-Serif &middot; UI + Headings<br/>DM Sans / System UI</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-7 rounded-xl border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <div class="mb-4 font-serif">
          <div class="text-[56px] font-bold leading-none text-brand-primary"><span class="text-foreground-secondary">Aa</span> <span class="text-[40px] not-italic" style="font-family: inherit;">あいう</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-foreground-tertiary">Serif &middot; Editorial + CJK<br/>Noto Serif / Yu Mincho</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-7 rounded-xl border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <div class="mb-4 font-mono">
          <div class="text-[56px] font-bold leading-none text-brand-primary"><span class="text-brand-accent">Aa</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-foreground-tertiary">Mono &middot; Code<br/>JetBrains Mono / SF Mono</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3 text-foreground-secondary">Scale</h3>
    <div class="type-scale">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-4 rounded-lg border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <span class="w-[100px] text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary">Display</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-display font-bold tracking-tight leading-display">Mizunagi</span>
        <span class="text-xs shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary font-mono">36px &middot; 700 &middot; 1.10</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-4 rounded-lg border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <span class="w-[100px] text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary">H1</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-h1 font-bold tracking-snug leading-h1">Color System &middot; Palette</span>
        <span class="text-xs shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary font-mono">24px &middot; 700 &middot; 1.20</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-4 rounded-lg border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <span class="w-[100px] text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary">H2</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-h2 font-semibold leading-h2">Canvas &middot; Brand &middot; Neutrals</span>
        <span class="text-xs shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary font-mono">18px &middot; 600 &middot; 1.25</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-4 rounded-lg border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <span class="w-[100px] text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary">H3</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-h3 font-semibold leading-h3">Tag Tints &middot; Solid Hex</span>
        <span class="text-xs shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary font-mono">16px &middot; 600 &middot; 1.30</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-4 rounded-lg border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <span class="w-[100px] text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary">Body</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-body font-normal leading-body text-foreground-secondary">The primary navy covers no more than 10% of any page. Beyond that is clutter, not restraint. All grays are neutral.</span>
        <span class="text-xs shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary font-mono">14px &middot; 400 &middot; 1.60</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-4 rounded-lg border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <span class="w-[100px] text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary">Caption</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-caption font-normal leading-caption text-foreground-tertiary">Figure notes, footnotes, annotation text</span>
        <span class="text-xs shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary font-mono">12px &middot; 400 &middot; 1.45</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-4 rounded-lg border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <span class="w-[100px] text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary">Label</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-label font-semibold leading-label uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground-tertiary">Design System &middot; v0.12.6</span>
        <span class="text-xs shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary font-mono">10px &middot; 600 &middot; 1.35</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-6 p-4 rounded-lg border bg-surface-base border-surface-muted">
        <span class="w-[100px] text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary">Serif</span>
        <span class="flex-1 text-body font-serif leading-body text-foreground-secondary">デザインシステムは、一貫性のあるインターフェースを構築するための基盤です。日本語と中国語も美しく表示。</span>
        <span class="text-xs shrink-0 text-foreground-tertiary font-mono">14px &middot; 400 &middot; 1.60 &middot; Serif</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
